[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3639194946","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113868#issuecomment-3639194946","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113868","id":3639194946,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Y6bVC","user":{"login":"Gramps","id":1097098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTcwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1097098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps","html_url":"https://github.com/Gramps","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-10T22:20:06Z","updated_at":"2025-12-10T22:20:06Z","body":"I also noticed [the steam_tracker.cpp seems to link the SDK files](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d743736f84fb668bcdfb5bf86258e483f35c6fec/main/steam_tracker.cpp#L39) but none exist for Linux or Mac so that might be why this is limited to Windows.  Is there a reason these files aren't shipped on Linux or Mac and only Windows?\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3639194946/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3639329089","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113868#issuecomment-3639329089","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113868","id":3639329089,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Y68FB","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-10T23:12:08Z","updated_at":"2025-12-10T23:12:08Z","body":"> I also noticed [the steam_tracker.cpp seems to link the SDK files](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d743736f84fb668bcdfb5bf86258e483f35c6fec/main/steam_tracker.cpp#L39) but none exist for Linux or Mac so that might be why this is limited to Windows. Is there a reason these files aren't shipped on Linux or Mac and only Windows?\n\nThis was added to fix time tracking on Windows, it's working fine out of the box on Linux so we don't make Steam-specific builds for it. We thought it wasn't necessary for macOS either, but it seems this was a wrong assumption (#111563), so we'll have to update our build scripts: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-build-scripts/pull/131\n\nWe can definitely update the lib version we're using to mitigate this. As you say it might cause issues with older plugins that require the old lib but I assume that's less common/critical?\n\nCC @bruvzg ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3639329089/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3639386158","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113868#issuecomment-3639386158","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113868","id":3639386158,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Y7KAu","user":{"login":"Gramps","id":1097098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTcwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1097098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps","html_url":"https://github.com/Gramps","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-10T23:39:22Z","updated_at":"2025-12-10T23:39:22Z","body":"Yeah, I remember when it got added and I didn't notice anything weird at the time.  These reports have been recent so it may not have been much of an issue prior.  Might also depend on when you all update those files on the Steam version vs when things like GodotSteam get updated.\n\nIn theory, the SDK is supposed to be good with backwards compatibility so older plug-ins _should_ be fine, I think.  Otherwise projects like SamsFace Godot Steam API would probably stop working.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3639386158/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3640268389","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113868#issuecomment-3640268389","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113868","id":3640268389,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Y-hZl","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-11T05:45:54Z","updated_at":"2025-12-11T05:45:54Z","body":"For the time tracking version is irrelevant, so updating it should be fine.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3640268389/reactions"