ngine/godot/issues/comments/3803862035","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113868#issuecomment-3803862035","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113868","id":3803862035,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iulQT","user":{"login":"Gramps","id":1097098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTcwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1097098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps","html_url":"https://github.com/Gramps","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T08:39:34Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T08:39:34Z","body":"The 4.6 release on Steam still seems to have an older SDK file.  Someone reported the above issue and I asked for a screenshot of the files then forced a Proton install to double-check and the file does indeed seem to still be outdated.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3803862035/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3820399060","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113868#issuecomment-3820399060","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113868","id":3820399060,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jtqnU","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-29T21:18:57Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T21:18:57Z","body":"Thanks for checking. Seems like I had forgotten a small change to actually copy the DLLs to the folder I upload to Steam.\n\nThis should be fixed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot-build-scripts/commit/e793faab996aaefe37f1b381e574505f4c9dff59.\n\nI re-ran that part of the upload script and there should now be the newer DLLs on Steam. Could you confirm?\n\nBTW I get a warning about uploading `steam_appid.txt` in depots, is this something I should remove?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3820399060/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3820472235","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113868#issuecomment-3820472235","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113868","id":3820472235,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jt8er","user":{"login":"Gramps","id":1097098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTcwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1097098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps","html_url":"https://github.com/Gramps","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gramps/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-29T21:31:47Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T21:32:18Z","body":"No problem!  I didn't actually think to recheck on 4.6's release until someone mentioned the issue still existed.  Things get lost in the  shuffle.\n\nYep, it looks like that is the recent version.  And, yesh, you can remove the `steam_appid.txt`.  That is only used for testing things outside of the Steam client and Valve, in their docs, recommends you do not ship it.  The Steam client knows what app is running (or thinks it knows).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3820472235/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3820530775","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot